00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Aerial view of Oia, Santorini, with white houses and blue domes over the cliff.

00:05.000 --> 00:15.000
Drone sweep over the colorful architecture and tourists walking through the narrow streets.

00:15.500 --> 00:30.000
Scenic view of Ammoudi Bay: fishing boats in crystal clear water under the red volcanic cliffs.

00:31.000 --> 00:46.000
Interior of a local souvenir shop: a tourist examines handmade ceramics and Greek decorations.

00:47.000 --> 00:55.000
Wide shot of Vlychada Beach with its unique white rock formations and black volcanic sand.

00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
Drone flies over the shoreline as the sun sets over the Aegean Sea.
